      "item": 1,
      "group": "battery_ten",
      "heading": "1. **Severson et al., Science 2019**：早期容量变化统计特征预测总循环寿命。说明早期差分/斜率有信息，简单特征应作为基线；不是逐时点动态 RUL。[DOI](https://doi.org/10.1126/science.aau7705)",
      "identifier_keys": [
        "10.1126/science.aau7705"
      ],
      "matched_existing41": [],
      "status": "IDENTITY_CONFLICT_WITH_ACCEPTED_P01",
      "notes": [
        "The thematic text says Severson Science2019 and DOI10.1126/science.aau7705, whereas accepted P01 source identity is NatureEnergy2019 DOI10.1038/s41560-019-0356-8. Use accepted P01 for its actual claim; thematic citation identity unverified. Old file preserved."
      ]
