      "item": 5,
      "group": "battery_ten",
      "heading": "5. **Mittal et al., 2023预印本**：先识别 first prediction cycle/阶段，再预测退化并给RUL比例。预测起点本身值得建模；比例分母、事后FPC标签是关键风险。[arXiv](https://arxiv.org/abs/2308.03664)",
      "identifier_keys": [
        "arxiv:2308.03664"
      ],
