      "item": 6,
      "group": "battery_ten",
      "heading": "6. **Hell et al., Scientific Reports 2024**：健康指标 + SVR/GPR + 状态空间/UKF处理容量再生，外推阈值并给置信区间/SHAP。NASA B5/B6/B7固定起点T=70/80/90，B7阈值1.5Ah而另两只1.4Ah；区间必须核验覆盖率。[DOI](https://doi.org/10.1038/s41598-024-63160-2)",
      "identifier_keys": [
        "10.1038/s41598-024-63160-2"
      ],
      "matched_existing41": [],
      "status": "NO_EXACT_IDENTIFIER_MATCH_NOT_PROOF_OF_NEW_FULL_READ",
