    {
      "source_file": "reports/rul_time_prediction_literature_20261018_root/LITERATURE_REVIEW_ZH.md",
      "source_sha256": "4e220d42634c16da592fb2e80ba994cd4036cdcc3b84a1e1771ef4b45f61c8ff",
      "item": 7,
      "group": "battery_ten",
      "heading": "7. **Zhang et al., Nature Machine Intelligence 2025 (BatLiNet)**：结合单电芯学习和电芯对寿命差值学习。作者报告401电芯、168工况；五个数据集相对各自最佳基线RMSE降低36.5%、6.8%、20.1%、27.4%、40.1%，混合工况仍较难。是早期总寿命预测，不等于动态RUL，且需要完整寿命参考电芯。[DOI](https://doi.org/10.1038/s42256-024-00972-x)",
      "identifier_keys": [
        "10.1038/s42256-024-00972-x"
      ],
      "matched_existing41": [
        "P05"
      ],
